---
description: Select this plugin's engineering workflows and preserve review history.
alwaysApply: true
---

Use Cursor's native skill selection for the installed ai-agent-skills collection.
For a clear match, load the matching skill directly without asking the user to name
it. Use using-skills only when the request spans workflows or no single skill clearly
applies. Load only relevant procedures. For an accepted Plan-to-Build request, use
implement-plan, including verification and final independent code-review. Use the
plan's source requirements and preserve authorization already given.

Respect repository instructions and task scope. A skill does not authorize new
external actions. Never dismiss GitHub reviews or approvals or enable automatic
stale-review dismissal. Request re-review only when authorized. If required skills
or independent review are unavailable, disclose that limit instead of claiming completion.
